<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L3_3_5_1" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-03">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L3_3_5_1">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L3_3_5_1" name="3.5.1 Tailings Transport &amp; Distribution" processRef="Process_L3_3_5_1"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L3_3_5_1" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L0/L1/L2 Process. Moves thickened tailings from the plant to the facility by pumped or gravity pipeline and routes them to the active discharge point — the classification station, a deposition line or cell, or an emergency discharge — according to the deposition plan.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L3_3_5_1">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_3_5_1_dcs" name="DCS / SCADA">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_3_5_1_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Service_L3_3_5_1_3_5_1_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L3_3_5_1_g</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_3_5_1_tail" name="Tailings Operator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_5_1_3_5_1_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_5_1_e</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_5_1_n</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_5_1_e2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_3_5_1_s" name="Thickened tailings from thickening">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_1_1</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="Msg_L3_3_5_1_s"/>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Service_L3_3_5_1_3_5_1_1" name="3.5.1.1 Transport Tailings to Facility">
      <bpmn:documentation>Thickened tailings flow from the plant to the facility by pumped or gravity pipeline. Several pump stages may be needed depending on head and distance. Pipeline pressure, flow and density are monitored continuously; a pressure drop or flow interruption (pipeline failure, pump failure) is an environmental incident trigger and stops the transfer. [P754: mass flow + volume | magnetic flowmeter + nuclear density gauge | continuous (1-min) | Principles 1, 5 | PARTIAL — plant-to-facility boundary; TP-01]
ISA-95 level: 1 / 2
Actors: DCS / SCADA
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 1, 2; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 5
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: tailings_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_1_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_1_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L3_3_5_1_g" name="Line pressure or flow abnormal?" default="Flow_L3_3_5_1_3">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_1_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_1_3</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_1_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_5_1_3_5_1_2" name="3.5.1.2 Route Tailings to Discharge Point">
      <bpmn:documentation>Valves and lines direct the tailings to the classification station (where fitted) or to the deposition line or cell selected in the deposition plan. An emergency discharge to designated containment is used during upsets. Line and valve states are recorded so that deposited tailings can be attributed to a location.
ISA-95 level: 1 / 2
Actors: Tailings Operator; DCS / SCADA
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 1, 2; GISTM
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: tailings_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_1_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_1_6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_5_1_e" name="Tailings at discharge point">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_1_6</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_5_1_n" name="Stop transfer; divert to emergency containment; notify">
      <bpmn:documentation>Derived from the Process Flow Narratives section (not a row in the Process Decomposition). Pipeline integrity response; an environmental incident trigger; no L4 row.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_1_4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_1_5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_5_1_e2" name="Transfer stopped">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_1_5</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_1_1" sourceRef="Start_L3_3_5_1_s" targetRef="Service_L3_3_5_1_3_5_1_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_1_2" sourceRef="Service_L3_3_5_1_3_5_1_1" targetRef="Gw_L3_3_5_1_g"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_1_3" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_5_1_g" targetRef="Task_L3_3_5_1_3_5_1_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_1_4" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_5_1_g" targetRef="Task_L3_3_5_1_n"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_1_5" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_5_1_n" targetRef="End_L3_3_5_1_e2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_1_6" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_5_1_3_5_1_2" targetRef="End_L3_3_5_1_e"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L3_3_5_1">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L3_3_5_1" bpmnElement="Collab_L3_3_5_1">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L3_3_5_1_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L3_3_5_1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="1024" height="510"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_3_5_1_dcs_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_3_5_1_dcs" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="984" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_3_5_1_tail_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_3_5_1_tail" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="190" width="984" height="340"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L3_3_5_1_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L3_3_5_1_s"><dc:Bounds x="142" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="110" y="139" width="120" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Service_L3_3_5_1_3_5_1_1_di" bpmnElement="Service_L3_3_5_1_3_5_1_1"><dc:Bounds x="266" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_L3_3_5_1_g_di" bpmnElement="Gw_L3_3_5_1_g" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="522" y="70" width="70" height="70"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="451" y="20" width="100" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_5_1_3_5_1_2_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_5_1_3_5_1_2"><dc:Bounds x="678" y="235" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_5_1_e_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_5_1_e"><dc:Bounds x="916" y="247" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="884" y="309" width="120" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_5_1_n_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_5_1_n"><dc:Bounds x="472" y="405" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_5_1_e2_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_5_1_e2"><dc:Bounds x="735" y="417" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="703" y="479" width="120" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_1_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_1_1"><di:waypoint x="198" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="266" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_1_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_1_2"><di:waypoint x="436" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="522" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_1_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_1_3"><di:waypoint x="592" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="660" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="660" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="678" y="275"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="596" y="85" width="21" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_1_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_1_4"><di:waypoint x="557" y="140"/><di:waypoint x="557" y="405"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="563" y="144" width="27" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_1_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_1_5"><di:waypoint x="642" y="445"/><di:waypoint x="735" y="445"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_1_6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_1_6"><di:waypoint x="848" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="916" y="275"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
